5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what it's really like! I'll look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the visit to the station block's bin house.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I think it's important to understand the costs involved. I'll look into the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs, as well as the block ledger of refuse-point expenses.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll check the ward complaint log for this point and the station block's meeting minutes. It's probably best to see how others have handled the fallout before we dive in.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'll check the supervised mornings on the next lane and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk. I want to see exactly how much work we're signing up for.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log for this point. We need a factual basis for what is fair regarding the location.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Rin,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm glad we're all looking into different things. It feels like we're covering a lot of ground, which should help us find a balanced solution that works for everyone.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,Indeed. Let's hope this data prevents us from repeating the same mistakes. I'm curious to see if the complaints are as predictable as I suspect.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I'm just hoping we don't end up with a plan that looks great on paper but leaves one person doing all the heavy lifting. That's usually how these things go.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Efficiency is key. Once we have the data, we can evaluate the options logically rather than emotionally. I look forward to seeing the actual measurements of our frontages.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm just so excited to see what the bin house is like! I bet it's like a little fort for trash. I hope it doesn't smell too bad!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"It's a bit funny to think of it as a fort, Rin! I just hope that whatever we decide, it's something we can all afford and maintain together without any stress.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"A fort for trash is certainly one way to put it. Let's just make sure our ""fort"" doesn't become a monument to our inability to get along.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,Exactly. I'm not interested in a monument; I'm interested in a schedule that doesn't eat my entire weekend. Let's just get the facts first.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,We have already selected our research topics. Further speculation is unproductive until the results are returned. Let us proceed to the information gathering phase.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,Okay! I'm ready to find out everything! I hope the other lane's mornings are fun and not too boring. Let's go see what we find!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's all do our best to gather the information we need. I'm looking forward to hearing what everyone discovers so we can make a kind and fair decision together.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's get on with it then. I'll be interested to see if the ""facts"" actually lead us to a consensus or just give us more things to argue about.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I'm ready. Let's just make sure we're honest about what we find. I'll see you all in a bit with the details on the paperwork and the timing.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. I will focus on the objective data. Let us conclude this round and review the findings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
