60,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option B is the best! It's like a game, it's not smelly like the bin house, and we don't have to stand outside for an hour like in Option A!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Rin. Option B seems the most fair and avoids the high costs and hygiene issues of Option C, while being much less demanding than Option A. It keeps things harmonious.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option B is the only choice that doesn't invite a new set of fights. A is a chore, and C is a financial and olfactory disaster. Let's go with the rotation.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,I'm voting for Option B. It avoids the hour-long shifts of A and the bureaucratic nightmare of C. It's the only one that doesn't sound like a full-time job for us.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option B is the only logical choice. It addresses the spatial inequality of the current location and avoids the impracticality of the other options. I vote for Rotating Location.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,I'm so happy we all agree! Let's pick Option B so we can have a clean street and be happy neighbors!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,It really is a relief that we've found a solution we all feel good about. Option B seems to be the kindest choice for everyone's budget and time.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,It's rare we're this aligned. Let's just lock in Option B before someone finds a reason to start arguing again. It's the cleanest break from the current mess.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"I'm totally in. It's simple, it's fair, and most importantly, it doesn't leave me stuck doing all the work. Let's just get this decided and move on!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,The consensus is clear. Option B is the most equitable and practical solution based on the data we have gathered. I vote for Rotating Location.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for B! Let's make the bins move around so everyone takes a turn and nobody gets too grumpy!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,"I vote for Option B. It's the most balanced approach and ensures that no one is unfairly burdened, which is the best way to keep our neighborhood friendly.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll cast my vote for Option B. It's the only one that doesn't practically guarantee a future neighborhood feud. Let's keep the peace and rotate the bins.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,I'm voting for Option B. It's the only choice that doesn't sound like a total drain on our time or a headache of paperwork. Let's keep it simple!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I vote for Option B. It is the only solution that logically addresses the unfairness of the current location while remaining practical and sustainable for all households.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Rin,,B! B! B! I'm so glad we all picked the same one! Now we can all be happy and the street won't be stinky!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Midori,,"I'm so glad we could reach a consensus so kindly. I vote for Option B, and I'm looking forward to us all working together to make this new arrangement a success.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,My vote is for Option B. Let's just hope the rotation is the only thing that changes and we actually manage to stay on speaking terms.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,Option B! It's the only one that doesn't sound like a nightmare. I'm glad we're all on the same page—let's just make sure the schedule is actually followed!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I vote for Option B. It is the most rational decision to ensure spatial equity and long-term sustainability for all five households.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
